# Verify until Done + Ship

After any code change in this repo:

1. Read root `AGENTS.md` for verify commands and hard stops
2. Feature / hotfix / bugfix → follow project skill `ship-change`
3. Always loop with project skill `verify-until-done` (max 8) until PASS or stop and ask
4. Never claim Done on red verify; never skip verify for a “small” change
5. Commit / push / PR / deploy only when the user explicitly asks

✅ `cd frontend && npm run lint` then build before Done on UI changes  
✅ `cd backend && python -m pytest` on backend changes  
❌ “Fixed locally, you can run tests later”
